  "description": "Add timeless elegance to your creative projects with this Vintage Blue Rose Seamless Pattern Bundle. This beautiful collection features delicate blue roses, romantic floral arrangements, vintage botanical illustrations, and classic striped backgrounds inspired by French country and shabby chic décor. Soft shades of dusty blue, powder blue, ivory, and muted sage create a sophisticated and calming aesthetic perfect for a variety of creative applications.\nThese high-quality seamless floral patterns are ideal for fabric design, scrapbooking, journals, stationery, wrapping paper, invitations, wallpaper, packaging, sublimation, and print-on-demand products. Perfect for designers, crafters, and small business owners seeking elegant vintage floral backgrounds.\nYou Will Receive\n➤ 23 Individual JPEG Files\n➤ 12″ x 12″ Inches\n➤ 300 DPI High Resolution\n➤ Seamless Repeating Patterns\n➤ Commercial Use Friendly\nFeatures\n➤ Elegant vintage blue rose illustrations\n➤ Classic French country and shabby chic aesthetic\n➤ Soft powder blue, ivory, and botanical tones\n➤ Seamless repeating patterns\n➤ High-quality digital papers\n➤ Perfect for fabric, scrapbooking, wallpaper, stationery, invitations, packaging, and sublimation\n➤ Instant digital download\n➤ Suitable for personal and commercial projects",
